<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-EDU BECOMES FIRST FOREIGN SCORER IN ALBANIA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EDU BECOMES FIRST FOREIGN SCORER IN ALBANIA.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian midfielder Edu has become the first foreign player to score in the Albanian first division.</p>
<p>He gave his club Lushnja a 1-1 draw at Tirana on Wednesday with a spectacular header on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Last month, Edu became the first foreigner to join an Albanian club when he signed a one year contract worth $50,000 with Lushnja.</p>
</text>
